{
    "title": "Blood Pressure Tracker: Bp Log",
    "description": "Are you looking for a solution to track your blood pressure daily?\r\n\r\nThis blood pressure log bp tracker app helps users record their blood pressure. In addition, the application also provides basic to advanced knowledge about blood pressure. \r\n\r\nThis bp health app is reliable and safe, it calculates and gives quick conclusions about the user's blood pressure zone. The blood pressure noted in the diary is very flexible in terms of time, depending on the needs of the user.\r\n\r\n<b>Main feature of Blood Pressure Tracker: Bp Log app</b>\r\n\u2b50 Record daily blood pressure\r\n- The record blood pressure app allows users to fill in blood pressure information according to 3 values: Systolic (systolic blood pressure readings), Diastolic (diastolic blood pressure readings), and Pulse (heart rate measurements). In a few seconds, the indicators will be automatically updated on the application\r\n- Track your blood pressure, log blood pressure\r\n- After filling in, data for each day will be shown by a column (blood pressure chart) with a color corresponding to the blood pressure zone it belongs to. You can completely edit or update the entered indicators.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Know your BP condition\r\nThe blood pressure zone includes 5 zones, the application shows with the entered numbers, whether your blood pressure is positive, whether you have a normal blood pressure level or an unsafe level: high blood pressure/low blood pressure\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Edit data\r\n- Indicate the user's blood pressure zones so you can easily observe changes over a long period of time or compare them to other days\r\n- Review the entire history of input, edit, take notes quickly, or delete unnecessary data.\r\n- Indicate the highest, lowest, and average quickly, and last entered blood pressure readings.\r\n\r\nImport your daily health data and let the blood pressure diary app do its job.\r\n\r\n<b>Why should you choose the bp checker app?<b>\r\n\u2714 Useful, necessary for all ages\r\n\u2714 Accurate and useful from the knowledge provided\r\n\u2714 Fast data processing speed\r\n\u2714 Easy-reading graphics for your health analysis\r\n\u2714 Easy to use app to record blood pressure\r\n\r\nWith a professional and useful app like the app, you can keep a close eye on the health status of yourself or your loved ones. Through the process of tracking and taking notes in the application, you can recognize the health status of users and promptly react to it before it is too late. Therefore, you will always be in the best state of health.\r\n\r\n\u2757 <b>Note:<b>\r\n- The blood pressure checker application can only be used in medicine as a support device for writing down indicators and is incapable of measuring blood pressure.\r\n- The tips we provide are for reference only, smart blood pressure tracker\r\n- The bp checking application does not replace professional medical equipment\r\n\r\nIf you have any requests or questions about app check my blood pressure, please contact us. Hope you will always be happy and healthy with the blood and heart pressure app. Thanks for using our blood pressure record keeper app!</b></b></b></b>",
